<title>USA: Starwood may seek Westin Hotels - Barron's.</title>
<headline>Starwood may seek Westin Hotels - Barron's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some are expecting Starwood Lodging Trust to announce the acquisition of Westin Hotels &amp; Resorts when it holds a conference call next week on second quarter results.</p>
<p>Such a move has been rumored before, but Barron's said in its July 21 edition that sources close to the negotiations say that this time the deal is for real.</p>
<p>The financial weekly said knowledgeable people believe Starwood will pay about $1 billion for Westin, which is now owned by an investment group headed by Starwood Capital and Goldman Sachs.</p>
</text>
